Third-Party Dependencies

The following third-party NuGet packages are resolved by restore for the
distributable Azclips components (including the `az` CLI, `azclips-agent`, the
`az-tui` dashboard, and the `Azclips.*` PowerShell modules). Names, versions,
and declared licenses reflect the resolved declarations after restore.

Scope notes:

- Test-only and benchmarking dependencies are excluded. For example,
  BenchmarkDotNet, Microsoft.PowerShell.SDK, and Microsoft.ApplicationInsights are
  referenced only by tests/Benchmark and are not distributed.
- npm packages under wiki/ (medium-zoom, mermaid, vitepress,
  vitepress-plugin-mermaid) are devDependencies used only to build the
  documentation site and are not distributed, so they are excluded.
- In the distributable PowerShell cmdlet projects under src/PS/, System.Management.Automation is referenced with PrivateAssets="all" and is
  provided by the PowerShell host at runtime rather than redistributed.
- Agent AI capabilities are provided through the GitHub Copilot SDK; no
  third-party AI model is bundled or distributed with Azclips.

